<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 72.4500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 72.4500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 72.4500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday from 72.6411 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Dec 13		  Dec 12</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     72.4500		 72.6411</p>
<p> volume ($million)	     4.220		  11.205</p>
<p>				    Dec 13		  Dec 5</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 47.0000		 47.3250</p>
<p> volume (DM million)	   0.050		   0.040</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
